{"meta":{"commit":"b2d04e166","date":"2026-11-09","file":"config_lados_eject_infuser_extra.jsonl","machine":"metallurgic_infuser","scenario":"BOTTOM=EXTRA (the item default) with 3 sticks in the infusion slot (a stick is not convertible, so it stays) and 64 clay balls in the output slot, ejecting on from tick 0, the right side changed to INPUT so the output slot can only leave through the bottom. At tick 40 BOTTOM=OUTPUT.","fields":"t: ticks after the first tick the scenario ran (the actions of tick t run in ServerTickEvent.Pre, the line is written in ServerTickEvent.Post, after the machine ticked); marks: the actions of the tick; facing; chests {world face: {item: count}}: what each of the 6 chests touching the machine holds (omitted faces are empty); output, input (and infusion, tank for the infuser): [item, count] of the slots, '' when empty; tick_delay: TileComponentEjector.tickDelay read by reflection; ejecting {type: bool}; config: the ITEM sides (front,left,right,back,top,bottom).","notes":["EXTRA na base não ejeta nada (DataType.EXTRA não é saída), nem o slot de infusão com 3 gravetos nem a saída. Com OUTPUT na base (tick 40) só a saída vai para o baú de baixo (o conjunto OUTPUT é só o slot de saída); os gravetos do slot de infusão ficam. O tickDelay é reiniciado em 10 mesmo sem nada para enviar."]}}
